{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":7},"Blanche Rhapsodie - Mémoire de théâtre","Le film rend hommage au \"21 rue Blanche\", ancien hôtel particulier ayant abrité l’École Nationale Supérieure des Arts et Techniques du Théâtre (ENSATT) de 1944 à 1997. Depuis 1997, quand l'ENSATT a été transférée à Lyon, la bâtisse est restée à l'abandon. Avant transformation du lieu, des anciens élèves, connus, reconnus, méconnus, inconnus viennent témoigner : les fantômes c'est nous !",[4,5,6],"artistic creation","self-employment","personal memory",{"type":8,"id":9,"slug":10,"title":11,"release":13,"filmType":17,"directors":18,"genre":26,"media":28,"synopsis":31,"production":32,"characters":35,"roles":36,"awards":104,"tags":3},"Film","FR2018_048","fr2018-048-blanche-rhapsodie-memoire-de-theatre",{"native":1,"english":12},"",{"type":14,"date":15,"year":16},"Theatrical release","2018-03-14",2018,"Documentary",[19],{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":25},"Claire Ruppli","claire-ruppli",0,"Female identifying","France",[],[27],"Documentary – Participatory mode",{"posterUrl":29,"trailerUrl":30},"https://fr.web.img2.acsta.net/c_310_420/pictures/17/11/09/17/33/0610749.jpg","https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=nY794Ihxmog",{"native":2,"english":12},[33],{"country":24,"share":34},"Majority coproducer",[],[37,41,49,55,61,68,74,80,86,92,98],{"person":38,"role":40},{"id":20,"slug":21,"name":20,"birthYear":22,"deathYear":22,"gender":23,"nationality":24,"awards":39},[],"Director of the film",{"person":42,"role":48},{"id":43,"slug":44,"name":43,"birthYear":45,"deathYear":22,"gender":46,"nationality":24,"awards":47},"Denis Lavant","denis-lavant",1961,"Male identifying",[],"Documentary subject",{"person":50,"role":48},{"id":51,"slug":52,"name":51,"birthYear":53,"deathYear":22,"gender":46,"nationality":24,"awards":54},"Dominique Besnehard","dominique-besnehard",1954,[],{"person":56,"role":48